        },
        "subject": "LU-20869 tests: speed up sanity-sec test_27c",
        "message": "LU-20869 tests: speed up sanity-sec test_27c\n\ntest_27c added and later removed 255 alternate filesets\nwith one do_facet round trip per fileset, 510 in all, so\nit is dominated by process and ssh startup. It averages\n7.6 minutes in CI.\n\nRun each of the two loops once on the MGS instead. The\nsame filesets are added and deleted in the same order,\nthe overflow check is unchanged, and a failure still\nreports the fileset that could not be added or deleted.\n\nOn a local single-node VM the test went from 112 and 110\nseconds to 45 and 40 seconds.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-sec env=ONLY=27c\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ieae25f0903db35252715fa78b5cad71c5b6bae77\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
